BEGIN KKAmana

EXTEND_BOTTOM HGWRA01 18 
IF ~InParty("KKNavar") !Dead("KKNavar") Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ EXTERN HGWRA01 kkan1
END

EXTEND_BOTTOM HGWRA01 24
IF ~Global("KKNavarLovedOne","GLOBAL",1)~ 
DO ~ClearAllActions() StartCutSceneMode() StartCutScene("KKAma01")~ EXIT
END

CHAIN HGWRA01 kkan1
~What of the inevitable pain you must give to the one you love? The barbarian you call Navarra?~
== KKNav25J ~He has brought me nothing but joy.~
== HGWRA01 ~You know nothing of what you speak, you are as much a murderer as my failed ward.~
DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarLovedOne","GLOBAL",1) ClearAllActions() StartCutSceneMode() StartCutScene("KKAma01")~ EXIT

CHAIN
IF ~NumTimesTalkedTo(0)~ THEN KKAma kkan2
~Navarra...~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavAma","GLOBAL",1)~ 
== KKNav25J ~Amana? How can this be real...~
== KKAmana ~Why Navarra? You killed me, you killed us all! I hate you for what you've done~
== KKNav25J ~I didn't want to! You made me! You had Shaelah lie to me, for your own ambitions!~
== KKAmana ~You may as well have killed our mother! She will never forgive you for this, ever! She will hate you too.~ 
== KKNav25J ~No! You did this, sister! I wanted to save you, all of you. No one had to die.~
== KKAmana ~You lie! You wanted us all dead, even mother, so you could take over the tribe.~
== KKNav25J ~NO! NO! NO!~

END
++ ~Don't listen, Navarra! It's a trick!~ EXTERN KKNav25J kkan3
++ ~You can't possibly believe this demon, it lies!~ EXTERN KKNav25J kkan3
++ ~No! Stop this, what are doing to her?~ EXTERN KKNav25J kkan3

APPEND KKNav25J

IF ~~ kkan3 
SAY ~This can't be real! It can't be happening!~  
IF ~~ THEN EXTERN HGWRA01 25
END

IF ~Global("KKAmaTalk","LOCALS",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKAmatlk
SAY ~How could that thing do that! How could it know about Amana?~
++ ~I don't know, but it's over now.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKAmaTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKAmatlka
++ ~You need to calm down, Navarra. Regardless of how or why, it's over.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKAmaTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKAmatlkd
++ ~It doesn't matter now, let's go.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKAmaTalk","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKAmatlka
SAY ~True, but that thing did what it set out to accomplish.~
= ~It got to me, and brought back all the pain, the anguish I suffered when they died. By my hand!~ 
++ ~You need to forgive yourself, you did what you had to. What they made you do.~ + KKAmatlkb
++ ~Pull yourself together, love. Things are only going to get worse, and I need you.~ + KKAmatlkc
++ ~Deal with it and move on. We have things to do.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKAmatlkb 
SAY ~I know and I thought I already had. But seeing her... I'll be ok.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKAmatlkc
SAY ~I know, you are right. I just need a little time.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKAmatlkd
SAY ~Easier said than done, my love. That thing wanted to either make you doubt me or make me doubt myself.~
++ ~And it worked, in part. Because now you're beating yourself up again over it, it isn't healthy.~ + KKAmatlke
++ ~You need to forgive yourself, you did what you had to. What they made you do.~ + KKAmatlkb
++ ~Pull yourself together, love. Things are only going to get worse, and I need you.~ + KKAmatlkc
++ ~Deal with it and move on. We have things to do.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKAmatlke
SAY ~True enough. I am not letting that thing get to me. I will be fine, in time.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKNavThroneTalk","LOCALS",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKNavThrtlk
SAY ~It seems that every Child of Bhaal we encounter is after the throne.~
= ~Is that your desire, as well?~
++ ~I want nothing to do with it, I just want it all over with. Why do you ask?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavThroneTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNavThrtlka
++ ~Not in the beginning. But now, I think it is.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavThroneTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNavThrtlki
++ ~Of course, that's been the goal all along. You know that.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavThroneTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNavThrtlki
++ ~That's none of your business, let's go.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavThroneTalk","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlka
SAY ~With everthing that has happened, I cannot help but wonder if you changed your mind.~
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I have thought about it a lot lately. I think I could do a lot of good.~ + KKNavThrtlkb
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Never. I want nothing to do with it, ever.~ + KKNavThrtlkd
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~The thought never entered my mind, I cant imagine my life without you. I love you, Navarra.~ + KKNavThrtlke
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I have thought about it a lot lately. I think I could do a lot of good.~ + KKNavThrtlkf
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Never. I want nothing to do with it, ever.~ + KKNavThrtlkh
++ ~I haven't decided yet. In the meantime, we have things to do.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkb
SAY ~Of that I have no doubt. Many lives would be better off, with someone as good as you are on the throne.~
= ~It would mean I would never see you again. I love you and would miss you, but you need to do what you think is right.~
++ ~I love you too, Navarra. But, we don't even know if it's going to happen.~ + KKNavThrtlkc
++ ~I know, which is why I even considered it. I love you too, but nothing is certain.~ + KKNavThrtlkc
++ ~I can't think about it right now. It may not even happen.~ + KKNavThrtlkc
++ ~I'll worry about that when and if the time comes. Shall we get going?~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkc
SAY ~Whether it does or not, I am here if you need me.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkd
SAY ~I was hoping you would say that, my love. I only hope you never have to choose.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlke
SAY ~I love you too, more than words can say. Never forget that, no matter what happens.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkf
SAY ~Of that I have no doubt. Many lives would be better off, with someone as good as you are on the throne.~
++ ~Exactly. But, I have no way of knowing if it will even happen.~ + KKNavThrtlkg
++ ~I can't think about it, right now. It may not even happen.~ + KKNavThrtlkc
++ ~I'll worry about that when and if the time comes. Shall we get going?~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkg
SAY ~True enough. Just know I'm here, if you need to talk.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkh
SAY ~I am very happy to hear you say that. I only hope you never have to choose.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlki
SAY ~I suspected as much. Why would you want to?~
+ ~Global("KKNavarraRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I believe I could do a lot of good.~ + KKNavThrtlkb
+ ~Global("KKNavarraRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~A lot of power comes with that throne. It's very tempting.~ + KKNavThrtlkj
+ ~Global("KKNavarraRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~It's my heritage, Navarra.~ + KKNavThrtlkj
+ ~!Global("KKNavarraRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I believe I could do a lot of good.~ + KKNavThrtlkf
+ ~!Global("KKNavarraRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~A lot of power comes with that throne. It's very tempting.~ + KKNavThrtlkl
+ ~!Global("KKNavarraRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~It's my heritage, Navarra.~ + KKNavThrtlkl
++ ~I haven't made up my mind yet, let's just go.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkj
SAY ~I can see the temptation, but what if it corrupts you? It would mean the end of us.~
++ ~I'm aware of the consequences, but I have to do what I think is best.~ + KKNavThrtlkc
++ ~Regardless of what happens, I'll never let anything come between us.~ + KKNavThrtlkd
++ ~I understand what's at stake. I love you, but I won't let that stop me from gaining what is mine.~ + KKNavThrtlkk
++ ~We'll see what happens when the time comes.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkk
SAY ~It causes me great pain to hear you say that. I may not understand, but I will not stand in your way.~
IF ~~ THEN DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarraRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3)~  EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavThrtlkl
SAY ~I can see the temptation, but what if it corrupts you?~
++ ~I'm aware of the consequences, but I have to do what I think is best.~ + KKNavThrtlkg
++ ~I understand what's at stake, but I won't let that stop me from gaining what is mine.~ + KKNavThrtlkg
++ ~We'll see what happens when the time comes.~ EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKNavSaradushTalk","LOCALS",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKNSDT
SAY ~You seem quite distressed by what happened back there.~
++ ~I still can't believe what happened. All those people... I can't help but feel responsible.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSaradushTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNSDTa
++ ~Of course I am. All those senseless deaths... it didn't need to happen that way.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSaradushTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNSDTd
++ ~Yaga-Shura... all the destruction.. I can't get the images out of my head.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSaradushTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNSDTa
++ ~I don't want to talk about it right now.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSaradushTalk","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN  KKNSDTa
SAY ~None of that was your fault, you did everything you could.~
++ ~I know, but it doesn't make it any easier to handle.~ + KKNSDTb
++ ~I know you're right, but there has been so much death and tragedy... I just don't know how much more I can take.~ + KKNSDTc
++ ~True, but it's still unnerving. I'm just glad that I have you to help me through it.~ + KKNSDTe
++ ~I suppose so. As much as I like to stay here, we'd better get back the group.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN  KKNSDTb
SAY ~No, it does not. But you must find a way to, I have a feeling things are only going to get worse.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN  KKNSDTc
SAY ~You have the strength to handle anything.~ 
= ~I'm here if you need me, my love.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN  KKNSDTd
SAY ~No, it did not. But you had no control over those events, nor was any of it your fault.~
++ ~I know, but it doesn't make it any easier to handle.~ + KKNSDTb
++ ~I know you're right, but there has been so much death and tragedy... I just don't know how much more I can take.~ + KKNSDTc
++ ~True, but it's still unnerving. I'm just glad that I have you to help me through it.~ + KKNSDTe
++ ~I suppose so. As much as I like to stay here, we'd better get back the group.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN  KKNSDTe
SAY ~I will always be here for you, my love.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END